# NPC skaters take turns at a spot. Four of them on the lines of two spots (the Big 3 and the manual
# pad): one rides each spot, the others wait at the top, a step back from the start. Whoever has
# waited longest goes when the spot's run ends; the one who just rode joins the back of the queue
# (for that tick three are waiting). Never two riding one spot, and never two waiters on one place
# (waitGap apart; they used to stack on the same step back from a start).
park soma
cmd 0 setData npc.parks.soma.lines ["west_flat_big3_runup","review2_west_runway_to_big3","manual_approach","manual_on_pad","manual_landing_right_turn_south_bank"]
cmd 0 npc spawn 4
run 3600
expect max npcs.crowded <= 0
expect min npcs.waiting >= 2 over 1..3600
expect max npcs.waiting >= 3
expect npcs.waiting == 3 at 449   # 489 before the NPCs' corners took the park carve's numbers, 570 before the carve
expect npcs.waiting == 2 at 450
expect max npcs.stacked <= 0
expect npcs.riding == 4 at end
